<title>USA: U.S. district court judge says Conrail ruling soon.</title>
<headline>U.S. district court judge says Conrail ruling soon.</headline>
<dateline>PHILADELPHIA 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. District Court Judge Donald Van Artsdalen said he would announce a decision within minutes in Norfolk Southern Corp's request to block the first step in an intended merger between CSX Corp and Conrail Inc.</p>
</text>
